WEBVTT

00:01:55.970 --> 00:01:57.760
Shougo-san!

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:04.890
Good morning!

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:28.210
I made some for you again today.

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:34.000
Have this instead.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:36.170
It's an eel and turtle jelly roll.

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:40.220
Since there is a limited supply, this is hard to get by.

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:43.180
Hey, Kannagi-san, don't get in my way!

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:44.140
What?

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:46.270
Shougo is going to eat my bread.

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:47.850
No, he's going to eat my boxed lunch.

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:49.640
No, my bread.

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:12.290
Hey, Kannagi-san, you're clinging a little too close!

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:13.630
It's fine, isn't it?

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:15.540
My club activities are on break.

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:18.960
It's always like this when you're going home, right, Tsuruma-san?

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:20.190
No!

00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:22.190
I'm not like that!

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:24.850
So you do something even more amazing?

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:26.640
I said I don't!

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:28.560
But do you think about things you want to do?

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:30.100
That's... Well...

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:30.890
Eh?

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:33.100
Stare~

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:40.780
It looks like the stock prices for the Mikadono
Group are changing favourably today, as well.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:47.720
Shougo-kun, there's no reason to look so unhappy, is there?

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:51.110
Being naked like this is so that I can get rid of my body odour.

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:53.690
Also, it's my mission to protect you.

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:54.500
It's not-

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:57.760
It's not that...

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:04.430
You're troubled because Tsuruma-kun and Kannagi-kun are getting closer to you?

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:05.680
It's fine, isn't it?

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:10.980
Originally, you came to this academy in search of women to become partners for life with, right?

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:12.140
Well...

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:13.820
If you make babies with both of them,

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:15.730
and marry whoever gets pregnant first...

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:16.860
How could I do that?!

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:19.070
You can do it if you make babies.

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:21.280
I'm saying that's what I can't do!

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:28.700
Also, if I do that... it will bother me.

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:31.270
If by chance, the girl I choose is my blood-related little sister,

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:35.790
then I won't be able to take the next step forward.

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:41.670
But Tsuruma-kun and Kannagi-kun are your childhood friends and not little sisters, right?

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:44.850
I definitely, definitely think so.

00:04:44.850 --> 00:04:48.430
But I can't remember that time clearly.

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:52.220
It's not like I don't trust the two of them,

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:55.600
but that thought keeps floating through my head.

00:04:57.270 --> 00:05:02.990
Hmm... Then, how about we try doing a DNA test?

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:06.450
Come to think of it, you said something about that before.

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:08.410
If you do a DNA test,

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:11.200
you'll know immediately whether or not they are your little sister.

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:12.050
Really?

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:13.120
That's right.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:14.210
However...

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:19.750
If the fact that you requested a DNA test to find the one daughter of the Mikadono family were to leak,

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:22.670
there's the possibility that it will invoke unnecessary speculation.

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:29.680
So it would be best if you request someone who you trust to do the test in your stead.

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:33.020
Somebody I can trust?

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:43.690
Shougo-sama... Hello?

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:45.150
Ah, Seri-san.

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:49.700
There's something I want to ask of you, Seri-san.

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:53.040
Eh, DNA test?

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:05.010
Um... collect a sample from the inside of the cheek with this cotton swab.

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:10.850
It can also test blood, urine and other body fluids.

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:12.680
Eh, urine?

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:17.810
DNA test?

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:21.560
It's not like I don't trust the two of you, but...

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:25.650
To put it clearly... How do I say it...

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:28.400
This is for our mutual benefit from here on.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:31.410
Our mutual benefit...

00:06:32.490 --> 00:06:33.830
From here on...

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:35.790
If it's for that, then I'll cooperate with the test.

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:37.000
Really?

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:37.710
Yeah.

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:42.220
If I prove that I'm not Shougo-san's little sister genetically,

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:45.210
no matter what we do, you can rest easy.

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:46.550
That's right.

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:51.970
First, I need to rub this on your membrane to collect a sample for the test.

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:54.470
The membrane?

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:56.600
But, in a place like this...

00:06:56.600 --> 00:07:00.140
Please. I need it for the test.

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:02.400
I understand.

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:06.820
The only person I would let do something like this is Shougo-san.

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:10.110
Also, this is my first time doing something like this...

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:11.780
Please do it gently.

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:12.990
Of course!

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:15.200
Then...

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:15.950
Wh-

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:17.370
Why are you taking that off?

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:20.160
Am I not supposed to?

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:23.130
To rub the membrane with the cotton swab...

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:26.920
The membrane... is the one in your mouth.

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:33.800
So Tsuruma-san really is a pervert.

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:39.060
Konoe, I'm putting it in.

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:50.950
I think that's enough.

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:53.490
Miyabi, you're next.

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:54.780
I don't want to.

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:56.080
Eh, why?

00:07:56.410 --> 00:08:00.140
Because when you put that in Tsuruma's mouth,

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:02.620
you had a really dirty look on your face.

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:05.830
You say it's for a DNA test,

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:09.760
but we don't know what you'll use it for later.

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:11.340
Shougo-san, could it be?

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:12.970
What are you saying?

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:14.260
There's no way that would be!

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:15.140
I understand.

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:17.510
Then, let's do it by a different method.

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:18.890
Different method?

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:21.770
Can you put any bodily fluids in here?

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:23.640
Bodily fluids?

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:27.150
In other words, blood or urine.

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:29.150
U-Urine?

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:34.320
I'm gonna do it.

00:08:34.730 --> 00:08:35.820
All right, do it!

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:47.210
You pervert!

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.260
Miyabi, wait!

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:52.130
It's a misunderstanding!

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:53.970
I didn't have dubious feelings.

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:54.590
I really...

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:56.340
Don't touch me!

00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:00.680
You pee fetishist!

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:03.140
Pee fetishist!

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:05.390
Pee fetish?

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:07.650
Pee?

00:09:08.070 --> 00:09:09.110
Hey!

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:11.400
What are you doing in the hallway?

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:17.260
Huh, what is this?

00:09:17.260 --> 00:09:19.660
It's nothing dubious.

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:21.990
Then it's fine, but...

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:26.210
Today is the day the board of directors are inspecting the academy.

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:29.290
I've heard that amongst the board of directors,

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:34.090
the son of Mr. Mikadono Kumagorou is being noticed.

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:37.760
As a student of Miryuuin Academy,
you should not do anything to embarrass us.

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:39.720
Be sure to properly straighten yourself.

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:41.640
Do you understand?

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:58.740
This will be on the midterm, so be sure to remember it.

00:09:58.740 --> 00:09:59.820
Teacher?

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:01.450
What is it, Tanaka?

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:03.830
Did I say something strange?

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:06.460
Midterms are already over.

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:27.230
I'm going to get a pay cut from the assessment.

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:29.230
I still have that loan to pay...

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:30.440
Here!

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:34.530
Hey...

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:36.580
So you were here.

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:41.200
President Tendou.

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:47.380
Come on, come on!

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:48.370
Hurry up!

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:51.580
One of the directors is saying they'd like to meet you, Shougo-kun.

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:52.840
Eh, me?

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:56.710
It's someone named Genda, the president of a large company.

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:59.360
He said if Mikadono Kumagorou's son is here,

00:10:59.360 --> 00:11:01.340
then he'd like to talk to him.

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:06.100
Oh, so you're Kumagorou's son.

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:07.520
Yes.

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:09.060
My name is Mikadono Shougo.

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:13.560
It's an honour to have been invited on this occasion.

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:18.400
Shougo-kun.

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:21.430
Since you're the only son of Kumagorou,

00:11:21.430 --> 00:11:24.200
that means you'll succeed the Mikadono Group, does it not?

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:26.950
No, not necessarily.

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:38.630
You're unusually level-headed for a young person these days.

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:41.130
If you became the successor,

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:43.720
the Mikadono Group will be in good hands.

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:44.930
That's not...

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:46.220
Onii-sama.

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:49.140
Can you hear me, Onii-sama?

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:51.480
I'm your little sister.

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:53.150
I'm Shougo Onii-sama's little sister.

00:11:54.190 --> 00:11:58.650
However, don't think I'm somebody you know.

00:11:59.060 --> 00:12:02.070
"Shougo Onii-sama", that means she's Mikadono's sister?

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:05.530
I heard that Mikadono-kun was an only child.

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:12.310
If you ignore this advice and search for me, think of this:

00:12:12.310 --> 00:12:15.390
The next time you try to search for me,

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:18.840
all the secrets I hold will be found out.

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:20.670
She's threatening me?

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:24.090
If that happens, it will be over.

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:25.550
Everything will have been for nothing.

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:28.220
Do you understand?

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:32.150
Please, just think that Mikadono Shougo doesn't have a little sister.

00:12:32.760 --> 00:12:36.680
That's the only path that can lead to everyone's happiness.

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:39.450
One more thing...

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:42.690
To Shougo Onii-sama, who is standing there with a befuddled look.

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:48.450
You have to be careful of the people around you, okay?

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:09.720
So this marks the third little sister for Shougo-kun, huh?

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:13.890
But this time it wasn't by phone, it was broadcast.

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:16.560
Why in that way?

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:18.520
What could the objective be?

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:28.820
Sorry for keeping you waiting.

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:30.530
So, how did it go?

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:34.590
Konoe had the cell phone, but...

00:13:34.590 --> 00:13:36.040
Sagara-senpai...

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:37.290
You lost it?

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:38.420
What do you mean?

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:42.220
Well, when I was cleaning,

00:13:42.220 --> 00:13:45.050
it fell into the garbage and was taken with unneeded articles.

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:52.680
The next day when I realised it, I went to the trash dump behind the school to get it, but it was already gone.

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:59.350
So this time, the offence took place in a more specific area.

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:01.480
But since anybody can enter to throw out garbage,

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:05.960
we won't be able to get any clues, will we?

00:14:05.960 --> 00:14:09.410
Shougo-kun, you're forgetting an important factor.

00:14:10.610 --> 00:14:17.080
The idea to use that mobile phone's voice changer should be restricted to the people you told.

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:21.510
Wait!

00:14:21.510 --> 00:14:24.490
Then, that means the little sister this time is amongst them?

00:14:24.490 --> 00:14:26.760
The possibility seems high.

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:27.980
That's...

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:38.550
Student council special public morals supervisor?

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:44.650
The board of directors said yesterday that the prank broadcast throughout the school was outrageous.

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:49.340
They pointed out that the public morals of the academy were in disarray.

00:14:49.340 --> 00:14:53.410
Until now, the students had independence,

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:58.660
but now the student council is taking the initiative to ensure the rules are enforced throughout the school.

00:14:59.100 --> 00:15:03.590
I thought it's fine the way it is, though.

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:05.420
What are you saying?!

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:08.470
In times like this, if the student council doesn't do something...

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:13.220
But I like school being fun the way it is now.

00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:14.970
President Tendou!

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:16.010
Um...

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:17.730
I understand the circumstances,

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:19.730
but why am I to become that student council member?

00:15:21.020 --> 00:15:26.880
Shougo-senpai is someone who the board of directors has paid attention to, and you're famous at this school.

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:31.270
What's more, you're adored by the first year girls as Onii-chan-senpai.

00:15:31.270 --> 00:15:33.610
That's something those girls did by themselves.

00:15:33.610 --> 00:15:41.960
Seeing a senior like that who leads a school life of
compliance with the rules should have a large effect.

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:42.960
But...

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:45.460
Moreover, in relation to this matter...

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:48.860
In a way, it's related to you, Senpai.

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:50.420
Ah, that's true...

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:55.930
So, you'll accept the position of student
council special public morals supervisor?

00:15:56.250 --> 00:15:57.350
Yes.

00:15:57.720 --> 00:16:00.500
Shiga-san, give that to Mikadono-senpai.

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:01.750
Y-Yes!

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:08.650
What's this?

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:12.160
It's the student council special public morals supervisor's armband.

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:16.410
Starting tomorrow, wear that and supervise inside the academy.

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:19.240
Also, I forgot to introduce you,

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:21.910
but this is the student council meeting log writer, Shiga-san.

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:27.290
She will be a colleague of ours in the special public morals supervision activities.

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:33.550
Mikadono-senpahi, it's nife to meet you!

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:42.020
I accepted this under pressure,

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:43.980
but why do I have to become the public morals committee member?

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:45.400
This is favourable, isn't it?

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:46.230
What do you-

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:47.690
What do you mean?

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:50.150
I investigated afterwards,

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:52.190
but when your little sister made that broadcast,

00:16:52.750 --> 00:16:55.500
Tsuruma-kun and Kannagi-kun were in the courtyard,

00:16:55.500 --> 00:16:57.990
so they gave alibis for each other.

00:16:58.490 --> 00:17:03.460
Sagara-senpai was apparently with
Kashinoki Kurumi-kun studying moe poses,

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:08.630
and president Tendou, who was with
Shougo-kun, was excluded from the start,

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:13.510
so the only person left unaccounted for was Kunitachi-san.

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:18.550
But, Kunitachi-san came into the conference room immediately after that broadcast.

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:21.010
What was that broadcast just now?!

00:17:21.010 --> 00:17:23.270
Even for a prank, that's going too far!

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:25.520
I-I'm sorry!

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:28.710
I had heard liberty was a school tradition here,

00:17:28.710 --> 00:17:31.020
but I didn't think it went this far.

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:32.900
Excuse me!

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:34.900
Ooh, Kunitachi-kun!

00:17:36.340 --> 00:17:39.160
Mikadono-senpai, what was that just now?

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:41.540
I don't know myself...

00:17:41.940 --> 00:17:43.420
You said right away,

00:17:43.420 --> 00:17:46.730
but wasn't there a little time after the broadcast ended?

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:49.040
Well, that's true.

00:17:49.320 --> 00:17:53.050
Then for now, the most suspicious person is Kunitachi-san.

00:17:53.460 --> 00:18:00.160
Shougo-kun, follow Kunitachi-san's actions as the public morals committee member.

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:03.390
If watching her goes well, we might be able to find something out.

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:05.140
Yeah...

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:15.440
What's the password?

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:16.700
Mushroom.

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:17.950
Bamboo shoot.

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:19.380
Man.

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.320
All right, enter.

00:18:27.150 --> 00:18:29.920
You've been looking forward to this exchange of loot, right?

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:30.880
Yeah.

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:33.210
If we mutually exchange loot like this...

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:34.770
...not only can we save our pocket change,

00:18:34.770 --> 00:18:36.430
but our feelings of loneliness will be abated.

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:41.270
Moreover, when you think about your favourite one being used by a friend,

00:18:41.270 --> 00:18:43.520
it has the feeling of stealing a lover.

00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:45.770
Then, let's exchange immediately.

00:18:47.530 --> 00:18:49.020
Stop right there!

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:50.140
Damn it!

00:18:50.140 --> 00:18:51.900
They got us!

00:18:56.610 --> 00:18:58.610
Shiga-san, check them please.

00:18:58.610 --> 00:18:59.800
Y-Yes!

00:19:05.250 --> 00:19:06.740
There were 3 "pia"s.

00:19:06.740 --> 00:19:08.460
Confiscate it and punish them.

00:19:08.460 --> 00:19:09.320
No!

00:19:09.320 --> 00:19:10.920
I only have one copy of my favourite!

